\* All TLC check configs for AntflyIndexLifecycle.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyIndexLifecycle.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySwapIncompleteShadow = FALSE
    BuggyRecoverTrustsStaleStatus = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    FreshImpliesCaughtUp
    NoFreshServeBehind
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    BuildEventuallyConverges

==== BadRecoverTrustsStatus
\* Expected-failure config: crash recovery trusts a stale durable "fresh"
\* status snapshot without re-validating the watermarks, and a query is then
\* served fresh results from a behind index. Pinned to the query-facing
\* invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySwapIncompleteShadow = FALSE
    BuggyRecoverTrustsStaleStatus = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoFreshServeBehind

==== BadSwapIncomplete
\* Expected-failure config: the shadow index swaps in while its applied
\* watermark is still behind the write target. Pinned to the freshness
\* contract.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggySwapIncompleteShadow = TRUE
    BuggyRecoverTrustsStaleStatus = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    FreshImpliesCaughtUp
